<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ūrēdo</span></b> ,
		ĭnis, f.
		uro. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A blast</i>, <i>blight</i> of plants,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				N. D. 3, 35, 86</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18,
				28, 69, § 279</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 3, 20,
				1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A burning itch</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 45,
				68, § 147</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">App. M. 8,
				p. 215, 18</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
